OL,3,GNEWSAStudent stabbing highlights campus
OL,4,Asafety push
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll buildings on a Leicester university
OL,7,Fcampus will have secure card entry by
OL,8,Fthe beginning of next year.
OL,10,FKatie Normington, vice chancellor at De
OL,11,FMontfort University (DMU), said the
OL,12,Fmove was among a number of precautions,
OL,13,Fincluding removing pointed knives from
OL,14,Fhalls and kitchens to make the city
OL,15,Fcampus as safe as possible.
OL,17,FSpeaking to BBC Leicester, she
OL,18,Facknowledged that the fatal stabbing of
OL,19,FDMU student Khaleed Oladipo in February
OL,20,Fhad highlighted the issue of student
OL,21,Fsafety, but emphasised work had been
OL,22,Fongoing.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
